    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43971" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθετ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be suitable, convenient</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθετεῖ πᾶσι χρῆσθαι</span> for all to use, <i><span class="en">
